# Benchmark and test assets — kept local, not shipped.
# The vulnerable fixtures, ground truth, scoring harnesses and their generated
# output (scan JSON, CodeQL SARIF) exist to measure the engine, not to run it.
# Nothing under sast-engine/ or server.js imports any of this, so the engine
# builds and runs identically without it.
benchmark/
.sast-engineignore
ENGINE_BENCHMARK.md
SCAN_STRESS_TEST.md
